{"id":"ko-a1-l008","level":8,"language":"ko","supportLanguage":"zh_tw","revision":"3","status":"ai_reviewed","sourceId":"src.ko.lesson.a1-l008","title":null,"description":"Minsu 剛從學校來到 Yuna 家，說自己有點累。Yuna 請他休息，帶他進自己的房間。Minsu 想躺一下，便問房裡有什麼、被子在哪裡，以及有沒有枕頭。Yuna 也介紹房裡有窗簾。後來，Minsu 想起自己的包包，問是不是在房裡；Yuna 回答不在，但沒有說包包在哪裡。","blocks":[{"block_id":"l008.s1","block_type":"scene","speakers":["yuna","minsu"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t12","block_type":"turn","speaker":"minsu","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000022","knowledge":["ko.g.yo.addressee-politeness#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t13","block_type":"turn","speaker":"yuna","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000023","knowledge":["ko.g.request.seyo#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t14","block_type":"turn","speaker":"minsu","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000024","knowledge":["ko:intj:네#s1"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t1","block_type":"turn","speaker":"yuna","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000001","knowledge":["ko.g.ida.identification#c01","ko.g.ui.nominal-relation#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t2","block_type":"turn","speaker":"minsu","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000002","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01","ko.g.case.subject#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t3","block_type":"turn","speaker":"yuna","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000003","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01","ko.g.e.static-place#c01","ko.g.case.subject#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t4","block_type":"turn","speaker":"minsu","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000004","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01","ko.g.case.subject#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t5","block_type":"turn","speaker":"yuna","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000005","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01","ko.g.topic.aboutness#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t6","block_type":"turn","speaker":"minsu","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000006","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01","ko.g.focus.additive#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t7","block_type":"turn","speaker":"yuna","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000007","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01","ko.g.focus.additive#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t8","block_type":"turn","speaker":"minsu","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000008","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t9","block_type":"turn","speaker":"yuna","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000009","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01","ko.g.focus.additive#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t10","block_type":"turn","speaker":"minsu","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000010","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01","ko.g.case.subject#c01"]},{"block_id":"l008.s1.t11","block_type":"turn","speaker":"yuna","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000011","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01","ko:intj:아니요#s1"]},{"block_id":"l008.tc1","block_type":"teaching","kind":"structure","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01"],"examples":["ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000002","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000003","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000021"]},{"block_id":"l008.tc2","block_type":"teaching","kind":"structure","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01"],"examples":["ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000004","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000005","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000011"]},{"block_id":"l008.tc3","block_type":"teaching","kind":"contrast","knowledge":["ko.g.case.subject#c01","ko.g.topic.aboutness#c01"],"examples":["ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000003","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000004","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000005"]},{"block_id":"l008.tc4","block_type":"teaching","kind":"structure","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01"],"examples":["ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000012"]},{"block_id":"l008.tc5","block_type":"teaching","kind":"meaning","knowledge":["ko:n:거실#s1","ko:n:부엌#s1","ko:n:욕실#s1","ko:n:화장실#s1","ko:n:침실#s1","ko:n:소파#s1","ko:n:냉장고#s1"],"examples":["ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000013","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000014","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000015","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000016","ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000017"]},{"block_id":"l008.ex1","block_type":"exercise","type":"multiple_choice","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01"],"sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000003","answer":"방에 침대가 있어요.","choices":[{"id":"l008.ex1.a","text":"방에 침대가 있어요.","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex1.b","text":"방에 침대가 없어요.","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.itda.existence#c01"},{"id":"l008.ex1.r3a","text":"침대에 방이 있어요.","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.itda.existence#c01"}]},{"block_id":"l008.ex2","block_type":"exercise","type":"multiple_choice","knowledge":["ko.g.itda.existence#c01"],"sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000012","answer":"방에 가방이 없어요.","choices":[{"id":"l008.ex2.a","text":"방에 가방이 없어요.","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex2.b","text":"방에 가방이 있어요.","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.itda.existence#c01"},{"id":"l008.ex2.r3a","text":"침대에 이불이 있어요.","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.itda.existence#c01"}]},{"block_id":"l008.ex3","block_type":"exercise","type":"multiple_choice","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01"],"sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000005","answer":"이불은 침대에 있어요.","choices":[{"id":"l008.ex3.r3a","text":"이불은 침대에 있어요.","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex3.r3b","text":"이불은 침대를 있어요.","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.e.static-place#c01"},{"id":"l008.ex3.r3c","text":"이불은 침대가 있어요.","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.e.static-place#c01"}]},{"block_id":"l008.ex4","block_type":"exercise","type":"chunk_assembly","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01"],"sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000018","answer":["냉장고는","부엌에","있어요."],"choices":[{"id":"l008.ex4.r3a","text":"냉장고는","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex4.a","text":"부엌에","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex4.r3b","text":"있어요.","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex4.b","text":"부엌을","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.e.static-place#c01"},{"id":"l008.ex4.c","text":"부엌이","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.e.static-place#c01"}]},{"block_id":"l008.ex5","block_type":"exercise","type":"cloze","knowledge":["ko.g.e.static-place#c01"],"sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000019","answer":"거실에","choices":[{"id":"l008.ex5.a","text":"거실에","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex5.r3a","text":"부엌에","correct":false,"misconception":"ko:n:부엌#s1"},{"id":"l008.ex5.r4c","text":"거실을","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.e.static-place#c01"}]},{"block_id":"l008.ex6","block_type":"exercise","type":"cloze","knowledge":["ko.g.case.subject#c01"],"sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000020","answer":"이불이","choices":[{"id":"l008.ex6.a","text":"이불이","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex6.b","text":"이불가","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.case.subject#c01"},{"id":"l008.ex6.c","text":"이불을","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.case.subject#c01"}]},{"block_id":"l008.ex7","block_type":"exercise","type":"chunk_assembly","knowledge":["ko.g.case.subject#c01"],"sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000013","answer":["거실에","소파가","있어요."],"choices":[{"id":"l008.ex7.r3a","text":"거실에","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex7.a","text":"소파가","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex7.r3b","text":"있어요.","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex7.b","text":"소파이","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.case.subject#c01"},{"id":"l008.ex7.c","text":"소파를","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.case.subject#c01"}]},{"block_id":"l008.ex8","block_type":"exercise","type":"cloze","knowledge":["ko.g.case.subject#c01"],"sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000014","answer":"냉장고가","choices":[{"id":"l008.ex8.r4a","text":"냉장고가","correct":true},{"id":"l008.ex8.r4b","text":"냉장고이","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.case.subject#c01"},{"id":"l008.ex8.r4c","text":"냉장고를","correct":false,"misconception":"ko.g.case.subject#c01"}]}],"localization":{"yuna":{"name":"Yuna","introduction":"Yuna 是房間的主人，邀請同輩朋友 Minsu 進房休息。"},"minsu":{"name":"Minsu","introduction":"Minsu 是來拜訪 Yuna 的同輩朋友，剛從學校過來，有點累。"},"l008.s1":{"description":"Minsu 剛從學校來到 Yuna 家，說自己有點累。Yuna 請他休息，帶他進自己的房間。Minsu 想躺一下，便問房裡有什麼、被子在哪裡，以及有沒有枕頭。Yuna 也介紹房裡有窗簾。後來，Minsu 想起自己的包包，問是不是在房裡；Yuna 回答不在，但沒有說包包在哪裡。"},"l008.tc1":{"title":"說某個地方有什麼","body":"「場所에＋物品이／가＋있어요」表示某處有某物。방에 침대가 있어요. 是「房間裡有床」。想問有什麼，就用 뭐가 있어요?。있어요 是日常禮貌體（해요體）的說法。"},"l008.tc2":{"title":"問位置、說位置","body":"問東西在哪裡，用 어디에 있어요?；回答時，在場所後加 에。이불은 침대에 있어요. 表示「被子在床上」。說東西在某處，用「場所에 있어요」；不在某處，用「場所에 없어요」。"},"l008.tc3":{"title":"主語 이／가 與話題 은／는","body":"이／가 標示主語：名詞有收音用 이，沒有收音用 가，如 이불이、침대가。은／는 用來帶出話題；問過被子在哪裡後，用 이불은 接著談被子的位置。兩種助詞的作用不同。"},"l008.tc4":{"title":"說某個地方沒有什麼","body":"「場所에＋物品이／가＋없어요」表示某處沒有某物。방에 가방이 없어요. 是「房間裡沒有包包」。없어요 是 없다 的日常禮貌體，用來表達「沒有」。"},"l008.tc5":{"title":"家中的空間與家具","body":"방 是房間；침실 是睡覺的臥室，화장실 是如廁的廁所，用途不同。거실 是客廳，부엌 是廚房，욕실 是浴室。소파 是沙發，냉장고 是冰箱。搭配例句，練習說哪裡有什麼，或詢問各個空間的位置。"},"l008.ex1":{"prompt":"Minsu 參觀房間時問「방에 뭐가 있어요?」。請依參觀對話的資訊，選出 Yuna 適切的回答。","feedback_correct":"答對了！방에 침대가 있어요. 說明房間裡有床，既回答了 Minsu 問房裡有什麼，也符合 Yuna 介紹的情況。"},"l008.ex1.b":{"explanation":"방에 침대가 없어요. 是自然的句子，表示房間裡沒有床；但 Yuna 已介紹房裡有床，這個回答與對話資訊相反。"},"l008.ex1.r3a":{"explanation":"침대에 방이 있어요. 的助詞接法沒有錯，但意思變成床上有房間，把場所和裡面的東西顛倒了。Minsu 問的是房裡有什麼，應回答 방에 침대가 있어요."},"l008.ex2":{"prompt":"Minsu 找包包時問「제 가방이 방에 있어요?」。請依參觀對話的資訊，選出 Yuna 能用來回答這個問題的句子。","feedback_correct":"答對了！방에 가방이 없어요. 表示房間裡沒有包包，能回應 Minsu 的確認，也符合 Yuna 的回答。"},"l008.ex2.b":{"explanation":"방에 가방이 있어요. 是自然的句子，表示房間裡有包包；但 Yuna 回答過包包不在房裡，這個回答與對話資訊相反。"},"l008.ex2.r3a":{"explanation":"침대에 이불이 있어요. 是自然的句子，被子在床上也符合對話資訊；但 Minsu 問的是包包在不在房裡，這句沒有回答他的問題。"},"l008.ex3":{"prompt":"Minsu 想拿被子休息，問 Yuna「이불이 어디에 있어요?」。請依參觀對話，選出 Yuna 適切的完整回答。","feedback_correct":"答對了！이불은 침대에 있어요. 用 침대에 說明被子在床上，回答了 Minsu 問的位置。"},"l008.ex3.r3b":{"explanation":"침대를 的接法本身沒有錯，但 를 標示受詞，沒有標示被子的位置。이불은 침대를 있어요. 不是自然的位置回答；這裡要用 침대에。"},"l008.ex3.r3c":{"explanation":"침대가 的接法本身沒有錯，但 가 把床標成主語。이불은 침대가 있어요. 沒有說明被子在哪裡，不能回答本題；要用 침대에 標示位置。"},"l008.ex4":{"prompt":"獨立情境：朋友問冰箱在哪裡，你請他到廚房找。請用三個詞塊組成回答，先提冰箱，再交代位置。","feedback_correct":"答對了！냉장고는 부엌에 있어요. 先提冰箱，再用 부엌에 指出冰箱在廚房裡。"},"l008.ex4.b":{"explanation":"부엌을 的接法本身沒有錯，但放進本題會成為「냉장고는 부엌을 있어요.」，用 을 把廚房標成受詞，無法說明冰箱的位置。這裡要用 부엌에。"},"l008.ex4.c":{"explanation":"부엌이 的接法本身沒有錯，但 냉장고는 부엌이 있어요. 用 이 把廚房標成主語，沒有表達冰箱在廚房裡。本題要用 부엌에 標示冰箱所在的位置。"},"l008.ex5":{"prompt":"獨立情境：朋友想坐沙發休息，你請他去客廳找。請補完傳給他的訊息：소파는 ___ 있어요.","feedback_correct":"答對了！소파는 거실에 있어요. 告訴朋友沙發在客廳，讓他知道去哪裡找；거실에 用 에 標示位置。"},"l008.ex5.r3a":{"explanation":"填入 부엌에 會成為「소파는 부엌에 있어요.」，表示沙發在廚房。句子自然、에 的用法也正確，但本題請朋友去客廳找沙發，位置不符。"},"l008.ex6":{"prompt":"Minsu 想知道房裡有哪些寢具。請用「被子」補完 Yuna 的回答：방에 ___ 있어요.","feedback_correct":"答對了！방에 이불이 있어요. 說明房裡有被子。이불 是表示存在的主語，最後的 불 有收音 ㄹ，要接 이。"},"l008.ex6.b":{"explanation":"방에 이불가 있어요. 的主語助詞接法不正確：이불 最後的 불 有收音 ㄹ，要接 이，不能接 가。本題要填 이불이，表達房間裡有被子。"},"l008.ex6.c":{"explanation":"이불을 的接法本身沒有錯，但 을 不標示主語。방에 이불을 있어요. 不是自然的存在句；本題的被子是房裡存在的事物，應用 이불이。"},"l008.ex7":{"prompt":"獨立情境：朋友問客廳裡有什麼，你要介紹沙發。請用三個詞塊回答，先說客廳的位置，再說裡面有什麼。","feedback_correct":"答對了！거실에 소파가 있어요. 回答了客廳裡有沙發。소파 是表示存在的主語，最後的 파 沒有收音，要接 가。"},"l008.ex7.b":{"explanation":"選 소파이 會組成「거실에 소파이 있어요.」；소파 最後的 파 沒有收音，要接 가；應用 소파가，才能正確說明客廳裡有沙發。"},"l008.ex7.c":{"explanation":"소파를 的接法本身沒有錯，但組成 거실에 소파를 있어요. 時，를 沒有標示存在句的主語。本題要介紹客廳裡有沙發，應用 소파가。"},"l008.ex8":{"prompt":"獨立情境：朋友問廚房裡有什麼，你想告訴他有冰箱。請補完回答：부엌에 ___ 있어요.","feedback_correct":"答對了！부엌에 냉장고가 있어요. 說明廚房裡有冰箱。냉장고 最後的 고 沒有收音，要接 가。"},"l008.ex5.r4c":{"explanation":"填入 거실을 會成為「소파는 거실을 있어요.」，을 把客廳標成受詞，不能在這裡標示沙發所在的位置；要說「在客廳」用 거실에。"},"l008.ex8.r4b":{"explanation":"냉장고이 的接法不正確：냉장고 最後的 고 沒有收音，要接 가，不能接 이。本題要說廚房裡有冰箱，應用 냉장고가。"},"l008.ex8.r4c":{"explanation":"냉장고를 的接法本身沒有錯，但 을 不標示存在句的主語。부엌에 냉장고를 있어요. 不是自然的存在句；本題要說廚房裡有冰箱，應用 냉장고가。"}},"sentences":{"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000001":{"id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000001","surface":"제 방이에요.","atoms":[{"id":"ko:pron:제","text":"제","pos":"pron","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:pron:제":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:n:방+ko:cop:이다+ko:e:에요","text":"방이에요","pos":"n+cop+e","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:n:방":"linked","ko:cop:이다":"linked","ko:e:에요":"linked"}}}],"translation":"這是我的房間。"},"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000002":{"id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000002","surface":"방에 뭐가 있어요?","atoms":[{"id":"ko:n:방+ko:p:에","text":"방에","pos":"n+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:n:방":"linked","ko:p:에":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:pron:뭐+ko:p:가","text":"뭐가","pos":"pron+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:pron:뭐":"linked","ko:p:가":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:adj:있다+ko:e:어요","text":"있어요","pos":"adj+e","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:adj:있다":"linked","ko:e:어요":"linked"}}}],"translation":"房間裡有什麼？"},"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000003":{"id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000003","surface":"방에 침대가 있어요.","atoms":[{"id":"ko:n:방+ko:p:에","text":"방에","pos":"n+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:n:방":"linked","ko:p:에":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:n:침대+ko:p:가","text":"침대가","pos":"n+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:n:침대":"linked","ko:p:가":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:adj:있다+ko:e:어요","text":"있어요","pos":"adj+e","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:adj:있다":"linked","ko:e:어요":"linked"}}}],"translation":"房間裡有床。"},"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000004":{"id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000004","surface":"이불이 어디에 있어요?","atoms":[{"id":"ko:n:이불+ko:p:이","text":"이불이","pos":"n+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:n:이불":"linked","ko:p:이":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:pron:어디+ko:p:에","text":"어디에","pos":"pron+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:pron:어디":"linked","ko:p:에":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:adj:있다+ko:e:어요","text":"있어요","pos":"adj+e","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:adj:있다":"linked","ko:e:어요":"linked"}}}],"translation":"被子在哪裡？"},"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000005":{"id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000005","surface":"이불은 침대에 있어요.","atoms":[{"id":"ko:n:이불+ko:p:은","text":"이불은","pos":"n+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:n:이불":"linked","ko:p:은":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:n:침대+ko:p:에","text":"침대에","pos":"n+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:n:침대":"linked","ko:p:에":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:adj:있다+ko:e:어요","text":"있어요","pos":"adj+e","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:adj:있다":"linked","ko:e:어요":"linked"}}}],"translation":"被子在床上。"},"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000006":{"id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l008.000006","surface":"베개도 있어요?","atoms":[{"id":"ko:n:베개+ko:p:도","text":"베개도","pos":"n+p","dictionary_link":{"status":"linked","part_status":{"ko:n:베개":"linked","ko:p:도":"linked"}}},{"id":"ko:adj:있다+ko:e:어요","text":"있어요","pos":